round 80 high-quality models</strong>, unlocking a complete Industrial Zone filled with factory smokestacks, heavy-duty piping, storage tanks, logistics gear (oil drums, pallets), and a diverse fleet of detailed forklifts plus some new city buildings.</p><p><strong>The Ready-to-Go Scene (Compiled FBX File):</strong> Don't want to spend hours building from scratch? This option delivers a fully assembled, beautifully structured city scene combining both the Free and Full assets. Just drop the compiled FBX file straight into your project, and you have a massive, pre-lit, and ready-to-use low-poly environment instantly!</p><p>Built with game performance as a top priority, the entire mega-pack - including all industrial structures, buildings, and vehicles - runs on a <strong>single color palette texture</strong>, drastically reducing draw calls and ensuring smooth frame rates on any platform. Additionally, every single model is meticulously engineered with its <strong>pivot points perfectly aligned to the base</strong>, making grid-snapping and world-building an absolute breeze. Stop modeling from scratch and start creating your world today!</p><p>Enjoy and share your unique cities &lt;3</p></div><div class="more_information_toggle open"><div class="toggle_row"><a class="toggle_info_btn">More information<svg width="12" viewBox="0 0 37 20" height="6" aria-hidden="" class="svgicon icon_down_tick" role="img" version="1.1"><path d="m2.0858 0c-1.1535 0-2.0858 0.86469-2.0858 1.9331 0 0.5139 0.21354 1.0183 0.38704 1.1881l18.113 16.879 18.112-16.879c0.174-0.1696 0.388-0.674 0.388-1.1879 0-1.0684-0.932-1.9331-2.086-1.9331-0.577 0-1.111 0.23008-1.49 0.57992l-14.924 13.894-14.925-13.893c-0.3777-0.34998-0.9134-0.581-1.4902-0.581z"></path></svg></a></div><div class="info_panel_wrapper" style="display: block;"><div id="game_info_panel_3422269" class="game_info_panel_widget base_widget"><table><tbody><tr><td>Updated</td><td><abbr title="06 November 2026 @ 12:02 UTC"><span aria-hidden="